        "TileImage": "$($repository ba02f271-f256-41d7-97cc-c0a36e5db1e7).Image",
        "Description": "Very easy way to get the Heeeere&apos;s Johnny achievement in Bangkok. Eliminate four targets with a fire axe. All bodies must be found. I recommend having at least one distraction in your loadout and to start undercover in the linen room where you will find three of your targets and a fire axe. Your other target will be just outside the room and guards on the other side of the corridor drag all the bodies into that corridor and throw a coin or mixtape 47 where the bodies are for the guards to find.",
